# Pacing diagnostic (docs/re-battle-pacing.md): the whole first Delrich Temple battle (warp6, Jian with
# test stats kills one enemy per action), A every 20 frames from the first command to the field.
# Logs the battle main state (0x020B0010), its substate (ctx 0x020B85B8 +0x10), the round state
# (battle work +0x2E; work is the pointer at 0x020B8550, 0x02282940 in these runs), actor, work +0xCE/+0xD0
# (kill hold and fade counters, also the intro counters), +0xD4 (refill counter), +0xD6/+0xD8 (status
# ticks), battler 12's action step, the camera mode, and every call of the battle main func_020297d4
# (one line per game frame that runs the battle update).
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
watch u32 0x020B0010 main_state
watch u16 0x020B85C8 substate
include warp6
watch u16 0x0228296E round_state
watch u16 0x02282972 actor
watch u16 0x02282A0E w_ce
watch u16 0x02282A10 w_d0
watch u16 0x02282A14 w_d4
watch u16 0x02282A18 w_d8
watch u16 0x0228FC7C b12_step
watch u32 0x020B85A4 camera_mode
exec 0x020297D4 bmain
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8550 battle_work
peek u32 0x020B8624 dmgnum_array
peek u32 0x020B8640 battlers_base
battlers
press A 3
wait 17
press A 3
wait 17
press A 3
wait 17
press A 3
wait 17
